_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Can Reproduce in master (tested with 4.8.dev6)\n- Cannot Reproduce in 4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - OpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 581.80 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe plugin i am developping suddenly stopped reacting to Nodes, after some experimentation i concluded `_handles` is not being executed when nodes are selected, but it does run when Resources are edited\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInstall this script as a plugin, and edit some nodes / resources\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nfunc _handles(object: Object) -> bool:\n\tprint(\"Wont handle\", object)\n\treturn false\n\nfunc _has_main_screen():\n\treturn true\n\nfunc _get_plugin_name():\n\treturn \"asd\"\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A\nCan make one latter if needed","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot